// truesignal-drill-received: a fire drill reached the SIEM (low, informational). Every alerting query excludes drills.
// One result per sensor per drill; compare with the node's sensor count for drill-success tracking (F-802).
// Elastic twin: Docs/siem/elastic/truesignal-drill-received.json. Docs: Docs/siem/detection-rules.md
// Schedule: every 5m over the last 6m.
event.module="truesignal" event.dataset="truesignal.alert"
| event.kind="pipeline_test" labels.drill="true"
| table([@timestamp, host.name, truesignal.sensor_id, event.action, truesignal.details.original_severity])
